PUBLIC SERVICES COMMITTEE
MINUTES
A meeting of the Public Services Committee was held on Monday, October 6, 2025, in the Laramie
County School District #1 Boardroom and via electronic meeting, starting at 12:00 p.m. Those in
attendance were as follows:
COMMITTEE MEMBERS:
Torn Segrave, Chainnan; Dr. Michelle Aldrich (via Zoom); Dr.
Kathy Emmons; and Jeff White.
AGENDA ITEMS
8.
ORDINANCE _3,d READING
— Annexing to the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming. various
tracts of land completely surrounded by current City limits situate in eastern Cheyenne,
generally located south of Dell Range Boulevard, west of Dry Creek, east of North College
Drive, and north of Cheyennc Street.
Mr. White moved to approve on 3 and final reading, seconded by Dr. Emmons. Motion carried
by unanimous voice vote.
Connor White. Senior Planner, provided a staff report and advised there have been no changes
since approval on 2’ reading.
9.
ORDINANCE
READING
— Amending the Official Zoning Map of the City of
Cheyenne establishing the zoning classifications of: AR
- Agricultural Residential; MR
-
Medium-Density Residential: MUR
- Mixed-Use Residential and. MUB
- Mixed-L’se
Business, for land annexed to the City of Cheyenne generally located south of Dell Range
Boulevard, west of Dry Creek. east of North College Drive, and north of Cheyenne Street.
Dr. Emmons moved to approve on 3rj and final reading. seconded by Mr. White. Motion earned
by unanimous voice vote.
Connor White. Senior Planner, provided a staff report and advised there have been no changes
since approval on 2r reading.
10.
ORDINANCE
_2u’d READING
— Amending Section 2.2.8, Assigned Zoning, of the
Cheyenne Unified Development Code to eonfonn with the comprehensive revision of
Laramie County Zoning Regulations. (SPONSOR
— MR. SEGRAVE)
Mr. White moved to approve on 2nd reading, seconded by Dr. Emmons. Motion carried with Dr.
Emmons and Mr. White voting “YES” and Dr. Aldrich voting “NO.”
Seth Lloyd, Senior Planner, provided a staff report. Committee members Aldrich, Emmons, and
White commented on the item.
