### Page 3 of 3

```text
Dr. Emmons moved to adopt, seconded by Mr. White. Motion carried by unanimous voice vote.
Mr. White, sponsor of the item, expressed with great sadness the purpose of the proposed resolution
to fill the seat of his recently passed colleague. Mr. White thanked John Brodie, City Attorney, for
his work on the proposed resolution and committee member Aldrich commented on the item.
There being no further items for the agenda to come before the Public Services Committee, the
meeting was adjourned at 1:24 p.m.
Submitted by,
